OL,3,GNEWSAProtest after homophobic and      
OL,4,Aracist incidents                       
OL,6,FChichester Festival Theatre cancelled a
OL,7,Fshowing of A Midsummer Night's Dream,  
OL,8,Ffeaturing comedian Munya Chawawa, in   
OL,9,FOctober following the incident.        
